    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perry is a small robot with a big mission. Tasked with preparing a distant planet for human settlers, she must brave dangerous terrain and tumultuous weather to complete her mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During her mission, Perry learns about her fears, wants, and purpose through a heartfelt exploration of consciousness and the meaning of life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Prepare The Planet</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The atmosphere is toxic. Before humans can settle, much must be done, including planting seeds, testing dirt, and collecting scrap to prepare for all eventualities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432620/extras/e8ad873724bd202f92b92ea96e0b4cf0.poster.avif?t=1736349024\" width=800 height=800 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432620/extras/e8ad873724bd202f92b92ea96e0b4cf0.webm?t=1736349024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432620/extras/e8ad873724bd202f92b92ea96e0b4cf0.mp4?t=1736349024\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Brave Hostile Environments</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This planet will not be terraformed lightly: torrential storms and boulder fields threaten to blow Perry's mission off course.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432620/extras/5a5c0de8ed3574673fea4bf729d0281d.poster.avif?t=1736349024\" width=800 height=800 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432620/extras/5a5c0de8ed3574673fea4bf729d0281d.webm?t=1736349024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432620/extras/5a5c0de8ed3574673fea4bf729d0281d.mp4?t=1736349024\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore Where Nobody Has Before</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the first entity to set foot (or rather, repulsor) on this planet there are secrets to be uncovered. Be sure to check every corner for undiscovered treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432620/extras/4a5eedaad6c729b9420f536b60d25ade.poster.avif?t=1736349024\" width=800 height=800 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432620/extras/4a5eedaad6c729b9420f536b60d25ade.webm?t=1736349024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432620/extras/4a5eedaad6c729b9420f536b60d25ade.mp4?t=1736349024\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
