tore_item_assets/steam/apps/3432620/extras/5a5c0de8ed3574673fea4bf729d0281d.webm?t=1736349024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432620/extras/5a5c0de8ed3574673fea4bf729d0281d.mp4?t=1736349024\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore Where Nobody Has Before</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the first entity to set foot (or rather, repulsor) on this planet there are secrets to be uncovered. Be sure to check every corner for undiscovered treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432620/extras/4a5eedaad6c729b9420f536b60d25ade.poster.avif?t=1736349024\" width=800 height=800 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432620/extras/4a5eedaad6c729b9420f536b60d25ade.webm?t=1736349024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432620/extras/4a5eedaad6c729b9420f536b60d25ade.mp4?t=1736349024\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
